===Verb===
{{ru-verb|задава́ть|impf|pf=зада́ть}}

# to [[set]], to [[assign]] ''(an exercise, a lesson)''
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[мы|нам]] [[не]] '''задава́ли'''!|It was not our homework!}}
# to [[ask]] ''(a question)''
#: {{uxi|ru|'''задава́ть''' [[вопро́с]]/[[вопрос|вопро́сы]]|to ask a question/questions}}
# to [[pose]] ''(a problem)''
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[give]], to [[throw]] ''(a dinner, a banquet)''
# to [[give]], to [[administer]] ''(a punishment)''
#: {{uxi|ru|'''задава́ть''' [[трёпка|трёпку]]|to give a thrashing, to give a dressing-down}}
# to [[preset]], to [[specify]], to [[assign]]

